license:
  - AGPL-3.0-only
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Research software for projected weight gradients with exact incoming adjoints,
  transactional AdamW update previews and fresh residual-probe alignment audits.
  Includes synchronized Apple MPS component accounting, a durable confidence
  journal and a bounded synthetic oracle with source-bound report regeneration.
  Candidate reconstruction saves time at some isolated residual-block shapes,
  but complete audited attempts are slower even at conditional zero rejection.
  The declared past-only synthetic exact-margin grid accepts no evaluation
  proposals. NumericalPolicy remains unresolved. No training speedup,
  language-model result or independent learning confirmation is established.
keywords:
  - optimizer-aware auditing
  - projected gradients
  - AdamW
  - Apple MPS
  - reproducible research
